{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1483596-d-tr-how-to-create-portals-and-gates-and-other-powers-i-don-t-find-how-to-create","id":1483596,"title":"[D:TR] How to create portals and gates and other powers I don't find how to create","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-10T08:34:28-07:00","id":1483596,"title":"[D:TR] How to create portals and gates and other powers I don't find how to create","content":"Hello!<br /> <br /> I was reading Deviant this week with a friend and there is a series of power we want to know if they are possible:<br /> <br /> 1\u00b0 The capacity to create portals/gates between a place and another, letting other people cross or half-cross. Translocation seems something that would have this but I don't find any [or maybe I interpret bad something].<br /> <br /> 2\u00b0 Power who relie in external factors. Maybe there is a Scar I don't understand. But there is no power that needs <i>a tool</i> to work. The example from my friend is the idea of someone needing a cutting weapon to create a Ranged Lash of cutting air.<br /> <br /> Any help in this regards, even if homebrew, is welcome. And thanks for your time!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27384-altidiya","name":"altidiya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T09:27:18-07:00","id":1483611,"title":"","content":"1. There isn\u2019t really a vanilla Variation that does this. The closest things would be Astral Travel, which lets you enter Twilight and/or dreams, and Otherworldly Connection, which can \u201csummon\u201d otherworldly phenomenon. <br /> <br /> 2. You could use Power Failure, with the failure condition being \u201clacking the right tool\u201d. Or, a bit more elegantly, Preparation has a Deviation (Catalyst), which means the Variation requires some kind of tool or reagent to activate. By default, the catalyst can be reused, and if you don\u2019t increase the base Magnitude beyond 1, the Variation only takes extra time to activate when dramatically appropriate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">The longer I study science the more I am convinced that it is <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">functionally indistinguishable from what our ancestors would refer to as sorcery</span>. And I would know, being both scientist and sorcerer.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23730-scriptorian","name":"Scriptorian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23730_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T16:21:16-07:00","id":1483657,"title":"","content":"You can skin Variations however you like and Translocation's Conjuration Deviation lets you move things other than yourself. As mentioned, Astral Travel provides a limited means of long-distance transportation, and the two Magnitude 4 options for Blessing that aren't Destiny's Chosen can likewise have characters appear and disappear from places they ostensibly could turn up or have not been in.<br /> <br /> As Scriptorian notes, &quot;you need a focus for this to work&quot; is basically the exact purpose of Preparation's Catalyst Deviation, and I will add that the way Variations work means that unless you've applied the Recharge Deviation, you only need to take extra time to activate the Variation once, meaning the base Magnitude can comfortably go up to 2 or possibly 3 and still support a ranged Lash in practical terms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T19:06:24-07:00","id":1483674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1483596-d-tr-how-to-create-portals-and-gates-and-other-powers-i-don-t-find-how-to-create?p=1483657#post1483657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can skin Variations however you like and Translocation's Conjuration Deviation lets you move things other than yourself. As mentioned, Astral Travel provides a limited means of long-distance transportation, and the two Magnitude 4 options for Blessing that aren't Destiny's Chosen can likewise have characters appear and disappear from places they ostensibly could turn up or have not been in.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scriptorian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1483596-d-tr-how-to-create-portals-and-gates-and-other-powers-i-don-t-find-how-to-create?p=1483611#post1483611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. There isn\u2019t really a vanilla Variation that does this. The closest things would be Astral Travel, which lets you enter Twilight and/or dreams, and Otherworldly Connection, which can \u201csummon\u201d otherworldly phenomenon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe I explain me wrong. The idea is create [in concept of <i>what,</i> not appareance] something akind to Portal gun or Doctor Strange door to other place of the planet earth, a portal you can see and pass through and other people can pass without your direct desire. Like open a door or window to a house. I refer to this type of portal and not &quot;gates to other realms&quot;.<br /> <br /> About the response for the second question, that is perfect! Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27384,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27384-altidiya","user":"altidiya","date":".  fixing a quote 06-10-2022, 10:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27384-altidiya","name":"altidiya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T19:40:53-07:00","id":1483678,"title":"","content":"Translocation (p. 134) will let you teleport through space, though not really on the scale of across the entire planet. Sacred Flesh (p. 151) allows you to bestow the use of a particular Variation (say, Translocation) on another character. A creative reflavoring of the Fragment form of Sacred Flesh could represent imbuing a particular threshold or entryway with Translocation. Homebrew might be necessary to get closer to the method you're seeking; for example, a form of Sacred Flesh that works like Token, but the portal lasts either for one scene or until (Scar Power) people pass through, whichever comes first, and you have to set its destination the moment you place it rather than people using it being able to choose a destination freely.<br /> <br /> Take Sacred Flesh (Translocation) as a Variation without taking the Translocation Variation itself, and tag on the Self-Cannibalism deviation, and you can use your own portals but you can't teleport without placing them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T20:16:35-07:00","id":1483682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>altidiya</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1483596-d-tr-how-to-create-portals-and-gates-and-other-powers-i-don-t-find-how-to-create?p=1483674#post1483674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like open a door or window to a house. I refer to this type of portal and not &quot;gates to other realms&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had inferred as much; unfortunately, the closest thing to having a freestanding portal that people can use without your intention is to entangle Blessing (Supernatural Aid) with an Involuntary Scar, because the point of Variations is that they're attached to a person and Deviant is on the opposite end of the setting's power scale from the splats that can create portals anyone can use without their continued involvement.<br /> <br /> You might get really crafty with using Sacred Flesh to provide means of giving other characters the ability to Translocate or provide Supernatural Aid, but in the game as-written being able to set up concrete long-distance effects beyond the purely informative/communicative or arrival/escape-oriented is the kind of scale-breaker you'd see on a character in the End Stage \u2014 there's a reason analogous powers in Mage, Mummy, and Demon all have concrete limits on how they can connect different points in the same world (mages need sympathetic connections and Yantras to link locations beyond their sight, mummies can only connect openings in the same structure or go to a random destination, demons can vanish from one piece of Infrastructure to another or retrieve an item they've seen before or create a portal to another world for a few turns that requires them to create another portal to leave).<br /> <br /> What did you have in mind that this would be used for in the context of a Deviant game?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T21:10:32-07:00","id":1483688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1483596-d-tr-how-to-create-portals-and-gates-and-other-powers-i-don-t-find-how-to-create?p=1483682#post1483682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What did you have in mind that this would be used for in the context of a Deviant game?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the answer.<br /> <br /> The actual character concept goes as this:<br /> <br /> A girl with the power to create a &quot;opening&quot; between the tip of her weapon and the opponent, basically being able to ignore cover penalties with any weapon she has, and stabbing people at range with a knife. This have the associate narrative capacity of being capable to translocate objects between this openings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27384-altidiya","name":"altidiya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-11T21:23:27-07:00","id":1483772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>altidiya</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1483596-d-tr-how-to-create-portals-and-gates-and-other-powers-i-don-t-find-how-to-create?p=1483688#post1483688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A girl with the power to create a &quot;opening&quot; between the tip of her weapon and the opponent, basically being able to ignore cover penalties with any weapon she has, and stabbing people at range with a knife.</div> </div> </div> </div>The rules for what Skills can be used for ranged Lashes notwithstanding, this is mechanically just making attacks with the Armor Piercing tag.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This have the associate narrative capacity of being capable to translocate objects between this openings. </div> </div> </div>Do these openings need to exist for more than one turn? Because if not, Translocation covers this largely as-written.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}